    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it sounds good, but some of the more traditional investors on the board might push back and say ESG is just a distraction from our primary duty to maximize profits. can you add a section that addresses those concerns? maybe something that shows why sticking to a strictly profit-only model is actually risky or outdated compared to the ESG approach?",
